    "description": "The Education Enrollment Waitlist API provides access to waitlist information for educational program enrollments. This endpoint allows authorized users to retrieve the current status and details of students on waitlists for various educational offerings. Typical consumers of this API include educational institutions and administrative staff who need to manage student enrollment processes and assess waitlist dynamics. By leveraging this API, users can make informed decisions regarding admissions and resource allocation.",
